{
  "behaviorChanges": [
    "additive: new `tautline plan-authoring-standard` verb prints the plan-authoring standard (parallel workstreams + dependency graph, per-lane isolation, per-task model-tier tags, embedded execution-autonomy contract); read-only, always exits 0.",
    "additive: new read-side adapter knob `planning.authoringStandard.enforcement` (off|observe|advise|block, default advise) gates a plan-shape check at finalize-plan-review; absent-stays-absent so no existing adapter is regenerated.",
    "additive: a new plan-authoring wrapper skill layers the standard onto superpowers:writing-plans, and policy/13-planning.md gains the standard as default for T1+ plans (T0 exempt)."
  ],
